      "text": "React subscribes to demos/{uid}/accounts in Firestore.\nThe first snapshot loads the queue. Changes update it in place.",
      "originalText": "React subscribes to demos/{uid}/accounts in Firestore.\nThe first snapshot loads the queue. Changes update it in place.",
