      "text": "Re-attach the listener: its first snapshot is the saved state,\nthen updates follow. POST session is idempotent; no reseed.",
      "originalText": "Re-attach the listener: its first snapshot is the saved state,\nthen updates follow. POST session is idempotent; no reseed.",
